WEBVTT

00:10.690 --> 00:12.830
Mother! Guess what!

00:12.830 --> 00:14.290
What is it, Ten'yuu?

00:14.670 --> 00:18.560
Father is taking everyone 
to the harvest festival!

00:18.560 --> 00:19.750
May I go as well?

00:20.240 --> 00:21.560
Absolutely not.

00:23.020 --> 00:26.170
But my elder brothers are all going...

00:26.170 --> 00:29.420
You are different from your brothers.

00:29.420 --> 00:32.260
You mustn't do anything to stand out.

00:32.260 --> 00:34.890
Do not make any enemies.

00:36.860 --> 00:38.870
Yes, Mother...

00:45.220 --> 00:48.070
Forgive me. I can do nothing as your mother.

01:02.090 --> 01:04.050
So this is where you've been hiding.

01:04.050 --> 01:06.350
Oh, Brother Tenjun...

01:07.160 --> 01:09.690
Studying arithmetic 
and natural sciences again?

01:10.110 --> 01:11.800
You always work so hard, Ten'yuu.

01:12.430 --> 01:14.010
It's in my nature.

01:14.620 --> 01:17.970
You should at least attend the 
imperial meetings every so often.

01:19.590 --> 01:21.900
I have no interest in politics.

01:22.350 --> 01:24.310
Even though you're in the line of succession?

01:24.310 --> 01:26.390
I am the eighteenth son.

01:26.390 --> 01:29.680
My birthright is completely different
from the other princes'.

01:30.220 --> 01:32.910
I just want to live peacefully 
within my means.

01:40.280 --> 01:41.830
Prince Ten'yuu, it's terrible!

01:41.830 --> 01:43.010
Your mother has...

03:14.970 --> 03:17.970
"Divine Blessing"

03:25.580 --> 03:27.900
How are you feeling, Mother?

03:28.690 --> 03:33.320
I'm fine. After all these years, 
I've gotten used to it.

03:35.280 --> 03:37.920
I've received permission to browse
 the imperial archives.

03:38.300 --> 03:40.320
This time, I'm sure to find a cure.

03:41.010 --> 03:43.540
You've done enough, Ten'yuu.

03:46.080 --> 03:49.550
I'm quite certain no one can heal me.

03:49.550 --> 03:52.530
I want you to focus on yourself.

03:52.920 --> 03:53.960
I couldn't...

03:54.520 --> 03:59.180
As your mother, to see you live well
 will bring me happiness.

04:06.570 --> 04:11.610
<i>My own happiness is 
to see </i>you<i> living well, Mother.</i>

04:17.420 --> 04:20.870
Then, in the middle of my research,

04:20.870 --> 04:25.540
I received a message about a very 
precious potion from Salutania.

04:25.540 --> 04:27.500
I-Is that so?

04:27.910 --> 04:30.950
With such high-grade potions in circulation,

04:30.950 --> 04:33.730
there <i>must</i> be an outstanding alchemist here.

04:34.060 --> 04:37.640
As soon as I realized that, 
I decided to visit as a transfer student.

04:38.310 --> 04:40.190
So that's your reason, is it?

04:40.820 --> 04:45.560
In truth, I originally believed 
 you to be that alchemist.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.520
<i>Bingo.</i>

04:49.110 --> 04:52.930
Though I was wrong, 
I was still lucky to find you.

04:53.610 --> 04:57.990
I'm grateful you're willing to speak 
to this outstanding alchemist on my behalf.

04:57.990 --> 05:00.700
<i>Ugh, I feel so guilty.</i>

05:01.210 --> 05:06.840
Unfortunately, however, 
even if they're willing to lend an ear,

05:07.150 --> 05:09.240
it may yet amount to nothing.

05:10.500 --> 05:12.500
Why do you say that?

05:13.110 --> 05:16.960
You mentioned that there is a diverse 
range of status ailment potions.

05:17.300 --> 05:22.050
Yes. Different symptoms 
require different potions, you see.

05:22.590 --> 05:26.390
And not all potions will work 
for variances of the same symptoms?

05:26.970 --> 05:28.350
That's correct.

05:29.370 --> 05:32.170
My mother's condition has worsened over time.

05:32.550 --> 05:35.090
She grew too weak to walk before she knew it.

05:35.090 --> 05:36.980
Now she's completely bedridden.

05:37.660 --> 05:40.820
I cannot fully detail 
the intricacies of her symptoms.

05:44.230 --> 05:50.120
The alchemist may not be able to create the 
right potion without examining her directly.

05:50.860 --> 05:52.330
But that's...

05:52.870 --> 05:58.700
It's not possible to take an alchemist 
from the Salutanian royal palace to Zaidera.

05:59.270 --> 06:02.290
Nor would my mother survive the journey here.

06:12.900 --> 06:17.650
I wish there was a potion 
that could cure all status ailments.

06:18.050 --> 06:19.480
All status ailments?

06:19.960 --> 06:22.950
Something you might call a panacea.

06:24.680 --> 06:27.640
If something like that truly existed...

06:27.640 --> 06:29.210
It'd be a dream come true.

06:35.380 --> 06:40.340
My apologies. Thank you for 
listening to my woes for so long.

06:40.340 --> 06:41.510
Oh, it's fine.

06:41.840 --> 06:48.360
I don't know what else there is 
for me to try, but I'll do everything I can.

06:49.400 --> 06:52.680
Please relay this information 
to the alchemist.

06:54.520 --> 06:55.140
Of course.

07:01.760 --> 07:04.450
Trying everything you can, huh?

07:10.050 --> 07:11.330
A panacea?

07:13.470 --> 07:16.060
Why the sudden desire to make such a thing?

07:16.060 --> 07:17.290
Well, I...

07:17.900 --> 07:20.250
Is it for Prince Ten'yuu?

07:20.830 --> 07:21.750
Yes.

07:22.060 --> 07:24.640
You told me you wished to know his purpose.

07:24.640 --> 07:27.280
You didn't say anything about helping him.

07:27.280 --> 07:29.470
Did he ask to keep this a secret?

07:30.030 --> 07:32.460
No, that's not the case.

07:32.460 --> 07:35.810
It just seems like he doesn't want 
too many people to know the truth.

07:36.190 --> 07:37.410
I see.

07:37.410 --> 07:40.540
Even so, I'll need to know the details.

07:40.540 --> 07:43.650
The palace is worried about what
the prince is after too.

07:44.530 --> 07:45.360
I understand.

07:46.880 --> 07:51.460
I know how you feel, 
but please think of us too.

07:51.460 --> 07:53.830
Everyone wants to protect you, Sei.

07:54.490 --> 07:56.540
I'm terribly sorry.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.040
Now, then...

07:58.410 --> 08:03.820
You want to create a panacea 
to cure any manner of status ailment?

08:05.150 --> 08:08.800
I'm not sure if such a thing
 is really possible.

08:09.110 --> 08:12.510
Neither am I. That's like trying 
to catch clouds with your hands.

08:12.510 --> 08:14.780
And there's another serious complication.

08:16.340 --> 08:18.290
If you can truly make a panacea,

08:18.290 --> 08:23.070
I don't have the authority to provide
the recipe to the imperial prince.

08:24.690 --> 08:29.990
We'd need the prime minister...
or even His Majesty's permission.

08:29.990 --> 08:31.160
Yes...

08:31.960 --> 08:36.750
Well, I completely support 
your personal research on it.

08:36.750 --> 08:39.710
Huh? You support the research?

08:39.710 --> 08:41.090
Of course.

08:41.400 --> 08:44.440
For many, the more difficultvz
 something is, the more inspiring.

08:44.440 --> 08:45.670
But...

08:46.010 --> 08:50.260
I can see Prince Ten'yuu triggered
your interest in a panacea,

08:50.260 --> 08:52.640
and there's no harm in a passion project.

08:53.660 --> 08:55.400
Thank you so much!

08:55.400 --> 08:59.090
Just be careful when and 
where you do your research.

08:59.090 --> 09:02.310
We can't let him find out about your powers.

09:02.850 --> 09:03.770
Okay!

09:14.030 --> 09:16.900
Sei! You got a letter.

09:16.900 --> 09:17.910
Thank you.

09:20.940 --> 09:22.380
It's from Corinna.

09:22.380 --> 09:23.580
Corinna?

09:23.580 --> 09:26.590
The alchemist who looked after
 me in Klausner's Domain.

09:32.150 --> 09:34.720
Is it some kind of bad news?

09:34.720 --> 09:37.400
Well, not strictly speaking.

09:37.400 --> 09:40.680
I asked her some questions 
about creating a panacea.

09:41.020 --> 09:43.400
Didn't get the answers 
you were hoping for?

09:43.400 --> 09:44.900
Yeah.

09:46.190 --> 09:49.330
But it's not like I didn't learn anything at all.

09:50.280 --> 09:53.540
She couldn't tell me about creating a panacea,

09:53.540 --> 09:58.220
but she suggested some herbs that
 might have an effect on the symptoms.

09:58.220 --> 10:01.660
I see. As expected of an alchemist 
from the Holy Land.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.340
Huh?

10:06.340 --> 10:07.740
What's wrong?

10:07.740 --> 10:09.380
It's not in here.

10:09.380 --> 10:10.170
Huh?

10:14.890 --> 10:15.840
Oh!

10:19.320 --> 10:20.540
What's that?

10:20.540 --> 10:23.870
A dictionary of flowering plants
covering nonmedicinal varieties.

10:25.730 --> 10:26.860
Isn't this it?

10:26.860 --> 10:29.940
You're right. It's not regarded
a medicinal plant?

10:30.350 --> 10:33.970
Maybe only the alchemists
of Klausner's Domain know about it.

10:33.970 --> 10:36.120
Yeah, that's entirely possible.

10:36.120 --> 10:40.660
Since it's not medicinal, I don't know 
if our facility cultivates any of it.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.500
What's wrong?

10:43.500 --> 10:47.580
There may be lots of plants like this 
that aren't considered medicinal.

10:47.580 --> 10:50.670
On top of that, they may be hard 
to obtain in the royal capital...

10:50.670 --> 10:53.570
Researching this might be 
much tougher than I thought.

10:54.280 --> 10:55.630
True.

10:58.720 --> 11:01.310
You two sure get along.

11:11.960 --> 11:16.270
I'm sorry. Making that potion
 has proved most difficult.

11:16.270 --> 11:21.130
Or, um, that's what I heard 
from the alchemist.

11:21.130 --> 11:23.700
There's no need to apologize.

11:24.230 --> 11:29.440
But they really want to produce
 results before you depart.

11:29.440 --> 11:31.920
That's what the alchemist told me.

11:31.920 --> 11:34.610
I appreciate the concern.

11:35.150 --> 11:37.880
You'll be studying here for a year, correct?

11:43.980 --> 11:47.960
Actually, I've received a letter 
from a servant of my mother's.

11:48.470 --> 11:51.130
Her condition is apparently declining.

11:53.240 --> 11:55.240
Instead of studying abroad,

11:55.240 --> 12:00.920
I think my mother would prefer it
if I were by her side in her final days.

12:04.550 --> 12:09.650
Perhaps because the two of us have only
 ever had each other, I'm inclined to worry.

12:09.650 --> 12:10.820
My apologies.

12:11.780 --> 12:16.520
I understand how it feels to be 
far away from your own mother.

12:17.260 --> 12:21.000
I'm not certain how
 much longer I have left here,

12:22.670 --> 12:25.310
but I would love to speak with you again.

12:25.780 --> 12:27.520
Yes, I would like that too.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.300
Commander Hawke?!

12:52.300 --> 12:54.170
I've kept my promise, Sei.

12:54.710 --> 12:56.130
Your promise?

12:56.460 --> 13:00.970
You're the first person I've come to see
upon my return to the capital.

13:13.990 --> 13:16.450
How was your visit home?

13:16.450 --> 13:19.370
My father and mother are both doing well.

13:19.370 --> 13:23.250
However, the monsters are increasing in
our lands at a faster pace than reported.

13:23.730 --> 13:26.790
We may need to keep an eye on the situation.

13:27.260 --> 13:28.500
I see...

13:28.500 --> 13:34.210
Once things have settled down, 
I'd love for you to see my birthplace.

13:34.590 --> 13:39.800
I would too. I may be able
 to help as the Holy Saint.

13:39.800 --> 13:42.380
Oh, no! That's not what I meant.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.590
By the way, this is for you.

13:45.590 --> 13:46.560
Open it.

13:53.400 --> 13:54.730
Honey?

13:55.090 --> 13:56.730
A gift from my domain.

13:56.730 --> 13:58.180
Can I really have this?

13:58.180 --> 13:59.460
Of course.

13:59.460 --> 14:01.950
I brought it just for you, Sei.

14:02.300 --> 14:04.030
Thank you so much!

14:04.520 --> 14:07.430
I haven't seen honey in so long.

14:07.430 --> 14:11.000
Oh, is it all right to use this in my tea?

14:11.350 --> 14:12.000
Yes.

14:18.770 --> 14:20.720
Wait, this aroma...

14:20.720 --> 14:21.760
Is it apples?

14:21.760 --> 14:23.660
I'm surprised you recognized it.

14:23.660 --> 14:26.030
The honey is made from apple blossoms.

14:26.500 --> 14:28.840
It has a very distinct scent.

14:29.280 --> 14:34.030
Apple honey is rare, even where I'm from.

14:34.030 --> 14:36.250
This must be precious.

14:36.250 --> 14:41.310
It's true that we don't produce
 much of it, but don't you like sweets?

14:41.310 --> 14:42.820
I do...

14:42.820 --> 14:45.070
Then please accept this gift freely.

14:45.070 --> 14:48.160
I'm pleased to see you so happy.

14:48.800 --> 14:51.240
Th-Thank you very much...

14:56.770 --> 14:58.000
It's delicious.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.040
I'm glad.

14:59.930 --> 15:02.250
Really and truly glad.

15:04.090 --> 15:09.050
You seemed a bit depressed, 
so I'm relieved to see you smiling.

15:11.640 --> 15:14.250
I'm sorry for making you worry.

15:14.250 --> 15:17.850
Fret not. Were you ruminating
 on your research?

15:18.420 --> 15:20.300
I've hit a bit of a snag...

15:20.300 --> 15:23.230
But this has really helped me unwind.

15:23.620 --> 15:26.990
The honey has such a sweet, gentle flavor.

15:27.400 --> 15:28.490
I see.

15:31.080 --> 15:33.330
It's quite delicious.

15:33.330 --> 15:37.440
I've never used honey in tea, 
so I'm unfamiliar with the flavor.

15:38.150 --> 15:41.900
Honey tea is a great drink 
when your throat hurts.

15:41.900 --> 15:45.680
I recommend mixing it in warm milk 
when you can't sleep as well.

15:45.680 --> 15:47.550
I see it has many uses.

15:47.900 --> 15:51.660
Yes, they say that honey 
is a universal remedy.

15:51.660 --> 15:55.810
And it's also commonly said that 
an apple a day keeps the doctor away...

15:57.010 --> 15:58.090
What is it?

15:58.090 --> 15:59.850
I just had an idea.

16:00.330 --> 16:03.110
A potion made with apple honey...

16:03.110 --> 16:06.700
I was wondering if I could 
use this to make a panacea.

16:08.150 --> 16:13.020
Mixing totally different ingredients
with medicinal herbs might be the key!

16:13.620 --> 16:15.960
Why didn't I think of it sooner?

16:15.960 --> 16:19.120
I wonder if different honeys
will produce different effects...

16:19.120 --> 16:22.060
What about honey from lotus flowers?

16:22.060 --> 16:23.570
Oh, that's right!

16:23.570 --> 16:27.690
I can use my holy powers, just like I do 
when making high-grade healing potions!

16:27.690 --> 16:28.550
I can grow them myself!

16:29.000 --> 16:31.540
I tried to find some for you,

16:31.540 --> 16:35.520
but it doesn't seem apples are
for sale this time of the year.

16:35.880 --> 16:38.240
Then I'll have to wait until autumn?

16:38.240 --> 16:42.230
I was only able to get a few saplings.
Will that suffice?

16:42.630 --> 16:44.560
That's actually better!

16:44.560 --> 16:47.120
Your magic is practically cheating...

16:50.860 --> 16:52.700
This is the place, Sei.

17:04.130 --> 17:05.170
This is...

17:05.170 --> 17:09.060
You're going to use 
the Saint's conjury, right?

17:09.060 --> 17:12.520
I asked His Majesty to have 
it planted out of sight.

17:13.270 --> 17:14.510
Thank you very much.

17:14.510 --> 17:18.850
You can go all out. 
Have at it to your heart's content.

17:19.510 --> 17:20.430
Yes!

17:29.370 --> 17:31.390
<i>I want to be of help.</i>

17:31.920 --> 17:34.160
<i>Just like that gentle honey...</i>

18:18.180 --> 18:21.580
Thank you for responding to my 
summons at this early hour.

18:21.580 --> 18:22.850
It was no trouble.

18:22.850 --> 18:25.140
Have you gotten used to the academy?

18:25.140 --> 18:30.300
Yes. Everyone has been very kind and helpful.

18:32.050 --> 18:35.330
I hear that you are interested 
in medicinal herbs.

18:35.330 --> 18:37.100
Yes, a bit...

18:37.100 --> 18:43.880
Did you know that the founder of alchemy
was from our kingdom long ago?

18:43.880 --> 18:45.960
No, I can't say I did...

18:45.960 --> 18:46.920
I see.

18:46.920 --> 18:49.830
This alchemist was so incredibly talented that

18:49.830 --> 18:54.030
some of their formulas were lost
and never successfully replicated.

18:59.510 --> 19:00.520
What is this?

19:00.520 --> 19:05.230
Potions created by said alchemist that 
have been passed down in the royal family.

19:05.760 --> 19:07.920
They are known as panaceas.

19:08.590 --> 19:10.630
Panacea?

19:10.630 --> 19:13.530
It can remedy all manner of status ailments.

19:13.530 --> 19:18.650
Be it poison, paralysis, or disease,
this can cure them all.

19:21.120 --> 19:23.270
I'd like to offer these to you.

19:24.730 --> 19:27.310
Consider it a token of friendship 
between our nations.

19:32.750 --> 19:34.820
I cannot accept something like this.

19:35.260 --> 19:36.240
And why not?

19:36.840 --> 19:39.270
I am but a powerless prince.

19:39.270 --> 19:42.190
I cannot provide anything
 of equal value in return.

19:43.300 --> 19:47.950
I am the sovereign of this kingdom.
I cannot say I expect nothing.

19:47.950 --> 19:51.670
However, I do not need anything 
from you immediately.

19:52.080 --> 19:53.610
That's...

19:53.610 --> 19:55.880
Think of it as an investment.

19:55.880 --> 20:00.640
Those who have met you all tell me
 you are a man of integrity.

20:01.110 --> 20:05.100
<i>We</i> truly wish to become friends.

20:12.650 --> 20:15.680
In that case, I gratefully accept this gift.

20:23.700 --> 20:26.570
Sei! You have a letter from Prince Ten'yuu.

20:26.570 --> 20:27.500
Lovely!

20:27.980 --> 20:30.200
I heard His Highness is returning home.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.660
Seems like it.

20:31.660 --> 20:35.460
I'm a little sad we didn't get 
to say goodbye to him.

20:36.660 --> 20:39.060
We'll meet again if fate allows.

20:41.920 --> 20:44.990
I heard he has urgent business back home.

20:44.990 --> 20:47.670
It's because he got 
the medicine you made, right?

20:47.670 --> 20:48.960
Probably.

20:48.960 --> 20:54.520
His Majesty handled all the details, 
so I don't know exactly how he received it.

20:55.520 --> 20:56.730
I hope it works.

21:02.150 --> 21:08.910
<i>I hope to hear stories about 
Prince Ten'yuu's mother someday.</i>

22:51.260 --> 22:55.210
We should reach Zaidera in a few days.

22:55.210 --> 22:56.060
I see.

22:57.520 --> 23:01.480
I wonder who could have created
something like that.

23:02.730 --> 23:04.010
Well...

23:06.090 --> 23:08.670
I don't know who created it,

23:08.670 --> 23:10.910
but I know who did all they could to help me.

23:15.180 --> 23:20.290
I only spoke with one person about a panacea.

23:22.040 --> 23:25.010
I'm sure this will cure my mother.

23:34.930 --> 23:39.950
Next Time

23:34.930 --> 23:39.950
"Interlude"
